			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2457194">
									

<p>On the one hand, I don't mind the concept &amp; idea here. On the other, I'm not sure about how it was executed. The log of instances is admittedly pretty funny (and I think this could actually work as a mainlister, really; it makes plausible sense in-universe), but the document itself doesn't seem to read too clinically, and the article presented here almost reads like it's pitching an idea instead of a full, finished concept.</p>
<p>I wanna like it, but I dunno how to feel about this.</p>
<p>EDIT: While I'm downvoting ultimately, keep this up for the rest of the contest, if only to get more feedback on how to improve it. You're getting quite a bit of good feedback here and this could be salvaged really nicely.</p>

