			<div class="content" id="post-content-2457277">
									

<p>Agree with the other commenters- while not the most original idea, the &quot;complete moron&quot; aspect gives it just that little bit of needed novelty. I think turning the dial down from &quot;zany&quot; to &quot;tongue in cheek&quot; would vastly improve this (ie. &quot;shot while trying to befriend Chilean anarchists&quot; is plausible stupidity, &quot;last words were reportedly &quot;gimme a kiss&quot;.&quot; not so much)</p>
<p>Remember when you're working on Bathos/High Wierdness-type stuff that its just like horror- push either one too far and you fall over the cliff into narm. A few subtle gags with a lot of buildup and deadpan counterweight will get you exponentially more effect than just throwing everything you can think of at the page and hoping that the stuff that works makes up for the stuff that doesn't.</p>

							</div>

								
